dxdata: data notice

The song and chart data in this package (dxdata.json and the catalog served at
https://miruku.dxrating.net/api/v1/dxdata) is free to use, including in
commercial projects. There's no license to agree to and nothing to sign.

Credit is appreciated, not required. If you publish something built on it,
a line like this is plenty:

    Data from DXRating (dxrating.net)

Song titles, artwork, charts and other game content belong to SEGA and their
respective rights holders. DXRating claims no rights over them, and this
notice grants none.

The data is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.

The TypeScript code in this package is MIT licensed, like the rest of the
repository (see the LICENSE file at the repository root).
